5
00:00:48.521 --> 00:00:50.389
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> What do you think of London?

6
00:00:50.774 --> 00:00:51.910
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> It’s nice.

7
00:00:53.181 --> 00:00:54.182
I like it.

8
